# Build context for infra/Dockerfile (context = repo root). The image needs exactly: the root
# manifests + lockfile, the four workspace package.json files (so the frozen lockfile resolves),
# apps/server, packages/protocol, fixtures/gen-synthetic.ts and infra/. Everything else stays out —
# smaller upload to the Fly builder, and nothing personal can be baked into a public image.

.git
.github
.turbo
.vercel
.claude
.tunnels
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__tests__
*.log
*.md
.env
.env.*

docs
agents
evidence
presentation
scripts

# the web app and the browser engine are not part of the server image (manifests only)
apps/web/**
!apps/web/package.json
packages/sync-client/**
!packages/sync-client/package.json
apps/server/scripts

# Tracks never come from the build context: production's live on the hive_tracks volume, and a
# developer's fixtures/tracks holds their own music. The entrypoint generates the synthetic pair.
fixtures/tracks
fixtures/README.md
